.TH SKILLKORP-GUI 1 "2026-10-11" "skillkorp-suite 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
skillkorp-gui \- settings application for SkillKorp K20 and M20 devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B skillkorp-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
GTK 4 / Libadwaita application to configure lighting, polling rate, debounce,
sleep timers, DPI stages, buttons, key remapping and profiles of the SkillKorp
K20 Ultimate keyboard and M20 Ultimate mouse.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR skillkorpctl (1),
.BR skillkorp-tray (1)
